pr_body:
Fixes #43091 

This was introduced in PR #42919, which solved part of the issue here but didn't thread the sync handling all the way down. This PR does that.

@MihaZupan can you take a look?

review_comments:
Yes, we're no longer calling OnCompletedInternal for sync completions. That's the source of the bug -- we were both returning pending=false and calling the OnCompleted callback. Now we just return pending=false.

OnCompletedInternal doesn't log for the multi connect case anyway, there's an explicit check for it. I believe how it works is that it logs per connection attempt.

@MihaZupan Does that all sound right?
